{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "param-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Parametric curves and polar coordinates\nA [[参数曲线|parametric curve]] is an ordered map; [[极坐标|polar coordinates]] are a way to name points. Keep the interval, direction and repeated coverage when moving from a formula to a drawing. Tangents use velocity; length uses speed; surface and polar areas require their own coverage checks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**参数曲线与极坐标**：参数曲线是有序映射，极坐标是点的表示方式。由公式作图时保留区间、方向及重复覆盖；切线看速度，弧长积分速率，曲面面积与极坐标面积各自核查覆盖。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-definition",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[参数曲线|Parametric curves]]\nA continuous map $\\gamma(t)=(x(t),y(t))$ includes its nonempty real interval $I$. Its trace is the set of visited points; the map also records their order. Differentiability is an extra assumption.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**参数曲线**：连续映射 $\\gamma:I\\to\\mathbb R^2$ 连同非空实区间 $I$ 一起给出。像集记录经过的点，映射还记录顺序；可导是额外条件。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-distinction",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[同轨迹不等于同参数化|Same trace, different journeys]]\nEqual images can have different direction, speed or repeated arcs. A continuous monotone bijection of parameter intervals uses each old stage once. A regular $C^1$ change also requires a nonzero parameter derivative.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**同轨迹不等于同参数化**：同像仍可异向、异速或重描。区间间连续单调双射把旧阶段各用一次；正则的 $C^1$ 换参数还要求参数导数非零。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-tangent",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[参数曲线切线的速度条件|Tangents from velocity]]\nAt an interior point of a $C^1$ curve, $\\gamma'\\ne0$ supplies a tangent direction. The slope $y'/x'$ needs $x'\\ne0$; $x'=0,y'\\ne0$ gives a vertical tangent. Zero velocity alone decides neither existence nor absence of a tangent.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**切线的速度条件**：$C^1$ 曲线内点的非零速度给切向。斜率商另需 $x'\\ne0$；$x'=0,y'\\ne0$ 时竖直。零速本身不能决定有无切线。"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-length",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[参数曲线弧长与重复描画|Arc length and retracing]]\nFor a continuous, piecewise $C^1$ curve on finite $[a,b]$, $a<b$,\n$$L=\\int_a^b\\sqrt{x'(t)^2+y'(t)^2}\\,dt.$$\nZero velocity is allowed. The integral counts travelled distance, including each retraced arc.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**弧长与重描**：有限 $[a,b]$ 上连续、分段 $C^1$ 即可用速率积分，允许零速度；每次重走一段弧都再次计长。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-surface",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 410,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[旋转曲面面积与重复覆盖|Surface area and coverage]]\nFor a continuous, piecewise $C^1$ profile on finite $[a,b]$, $a<b$,\n$$S_{\\rm counted}=\\int_a^b2\\pi\\rho(t)\\sqrt{x'^2+y'^2}\\,dt.$$\nUse $\\rho=|x|$ about the $y$-axis, $|y|$ about the $x$-axis. Geometric area needs each surface patch counted once; tracing the profile once is insufficient.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**曲面面积与覆盖**：上述正则条件下积分 $2\\pi\\rho\\,ds$。绕 $y$ 轴取 $\\rho=|x|$，绕 $x$ 轴取 $|y|$。几何面积须把表面各块计一次；母线只描一次仍不足。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "polar-definition",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[极坐标|Polar coordinates]]\n$$x=r\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=r\\sin\\theta.$$\nAngles are in radians. The signed radius $r$ gives distance $|r|$; a negative value uses the opposite ray. Recovering an angle requires the quadrant, not just $y/x$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**极坐标**：弧度角和有向半径经上述映射给出平面点。距离为 $|r|$，负半径取反向射线；反求角度须核象限，不能只看 $y/x$。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "polar-nonunique",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[极坐标表示不唯一|Non-unique coordinates]]\nFor $r\\ne0$, all equivalent pairs add $2k\\pi$ to the angle, or reverse $r$ and add $(2k+1)\\pi$, with integer $k$. A positive radius and one half-open turn select one label away from the origin; $(0,\\theta)$ always names the origin.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**表示不唯一**：非原点可转整圈，或半径反号并转奇数个半圈。正半径与一圈半开角区间只在非原点选出唯一代表；原点的角度须另作约定。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "polar-trace",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[极坐标曲线的覆盖与重描|Tracing a polar curve]]\nFor continuous $f$ on $I$, trace $(f(\\theta)\\cos\\theta,f(\\theta)\\sin\\theta)$ over that interval. With $a>0$, $r=2a\\cos\\theta$ traces its circle once over any closed interval of length $\\pi$, twice over $2\\pi$. Track the point map, not just the period of $f$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**覆盖与重描**：连续 $r=f(\\theta)$ 须连同角区间逐点映回平面。$a>0$ 时，$r=2a\\cos\\theta$ 在长 $\\pi$ 的闭区间描圆一次，长 $2\\pi$ 时两次；半径函数的周期不等于点的周期。"
    },
    {
      "id": "polar-area",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 400,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[极坐标面积与单次覆盖|Polar area and radial coverage]]\nFor continuous $R\\ge0$ on $[\\alpha,\\beta]$, $0<\\beta-\\alpha\\le2\\pi$, the region $0\\le\\rho\\le R(\\theta)$ has area\n$$A=\\tfrac12\\int_\\alpha^\\beta R(\\theta)^2\\,d\\theta.$$\nSigned or longer sweeps need a separate region check. Non-repeated boundary points do not ensure non-overlapping radial segments.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**极坐标面积**：连续非负外径、正角宽不超过一圈时，公式计算径向区域 $0\\le\\rho\\le R(\\theta)$。带负半径或更长扫角须另查实际区域；边界不重描，不保证径向线段不重叠。",
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
